€Ena muthistorema me eroes duo diaphoretikes kopeles kai enan anonumo epistolographo.
Ena biblio musteriou.
Ena muthistorema skepses, gnoses, apolauses, peripeteias.
Kai pano ap' ola e Istoria tes Philosophias apo ten arkhe os tes exelixe tes mekhri semera."…
‚
Pio dunato, pio entono, pio bathu, pio amphilegomeno, pio musteriako, pio anatreptiko apo o,ti ekhoume diabasei os tora: to trito kai teleutaio biblio tes Trilogias tou Kosmou brisketai, epitelous, sta kheria mas. O pasignostos pleon kai polubrabeumenos Philip Poulman philodoxei na mas parasurei gia mia akome phora se kosmous agnostous, gematous peripeteies, muthous kai phantasia.
O Gouil, palios mas gnorimos, ekhei tora sten katokhe tou to magiko makhairi. Prepei na paradosei to pantodunamo oso kai epikinduno oplo sto lordo Asriel. Aute einai e entole pou ekhei apo ton etoimothanato patera tou. Pos tha to katapherei, omos, khoris te Lura sto pleuro tou; Mono mazi tes mporei na xeperasei ta muriades problemata kai tous kindunous pou paramoneuoun se kathe tou bema. Mono mazi, oi duo tous mporoun na epikheiresoun to anapopheukto teliko taxidi se enan akome agnosto kai musteriode kosmo."‰
†Sto biblio "Oi Istories tou Mpintl tou Bardou" perilambanontai pente paramuthia, to kathena me tous dikous tou eroes, pou tha sas kanoun na gelasete, na oneireuteite, na diaskedasete alla kai na... tromaxete.
Toso oi Magkl oso kai oi magoi tha apolausoun idiaitera ta skholia tou kathegete Ntamplntor, pou photizoun to ethiko didagma kathe istorias, apokaluptontas, parallela, mustikes ptukhes tes zoes sto "Khogkouarts".
Ena anamphibola mageutiko biblio, eikonographemeno apo ten idia tes Tz. K. Rooulingk, pou tha agapesoun oloi oi anagnostes tou Khari Poter.
Ola ta esoda apo ta suggraphika dikaiomata tou bibliou tha diatethoun sto philanthropiko organismo Children''s High Level Group (CHLG), pou ekhei stokho te beltiose tes zoes ton aprostateuton paidion sten Europe."
‹Oi anthropoi demiourgoun mia pragmatikoteta kai ste sunekheia ginontai thumata tes. E Athena epanastatese enantia se auto kai plerose upselo timema.
(Khiron Raian, demosiographos)
Me khresimopoiesan kai me kheiragogesan khoris kaneis na skephtei pos eniotha. Etan e daskala mou, eikhe analabei na mou metalampadeusei to pneuma ton ieron musterion, na xupnesei ten agnoste duname pou katekhoume oloi mas. Otan tolmame na taxidepsoume s' aute ten agnoste thalassa, deikhnoume tuphle empistosune se ekeinous pou mas odegoun, pisteuontas pos xeroun perissotera apo emas.
(Antrea Mak Kein, ethopoios theatrou)
To megalutero problema tes Athenas etan oti uperxe gunaika pou proegountan kata polu tes epokhes tes kai oti to edeikhne se olous. Plerose to timema; Khoris amphibolia. Ostoso tha eikhe plerosei akoma megalutero timema an eikhe katapiesei ten plethorikoteta tes. Tha etan gemate pikria kai apogoeteuse, tha anesukhouse diarkos gia to <>, tha elege sunekheia <>, tha paraponiotan ole ten ora pos <>.
(Ntintre O'Nil, gnoste os Enta)"
ŒO polemos -aute e "maure panoukla"- xespa sten Europe. H Gallia sparazei stis okhthes tou Som kai tou Louar, ekatommuria oi aikhmalotoi sta krematoria. O polemos kanei pio entono to khorismo, ten apousia, ten arrostia, ten anasphaleia. Mepos omos den eimaste panta upo apeilen, apokommenoi, exoristoi, sarakophagomenoi opos to phrouto apo to skouleki;
H "Panoukla", to deutero meta ton "Kseno" megalo muthistorema tou Kamu, katagraphei te sumperiphora ton anthropon s' enan kosmo pou moiazei khoris skopo kai mellon, s' enan kosmo pnigeres epanalepses kai monotonias. Ki auto pou kharakterizei tous anthropous den einai oi kineseis e oi omilies tous, den einai e autokratoria tes sarkas tous, alla oi siopes, oi kruphes pleges tous, oi skies pou rikhnoun stis prokleseis tes zoes."’
Muthistorema khamelon tonon kai upseles tekhnes, e "Aisthematike Agoge" theoretheke apo pollous kritikous ergo anotero kai apo te "Mantam Mpobaru" (1857), ergo bgalmeno kateutheian apo ergasteri megalou zographou pou apeikonizei pista kai aisthantika mia oloklere epokhe."—
”Mia oikogeneiake kheirotekhnia pou kleinei. Ena gigantio emporiko Kentro-phrourio pou exaplonetai. Auto einai to skeniko tes "Spelias", e aphorme gia na sumplerosei o Portogalos suggrapheas ten "akousia trilogia" tou (mazi me ta erga "Peri tuphlotetos" kai "Ola ta onomata") kai ton problematismo tou gia te nea taxe tou kosmou. O Saramagkou aphegeitai tis tukhes tou Sipriano Algkor, enos keramopoiou pou blepei ten tekhne tou kai ten oikogeneiake tou zoe na allazoun otan to musteriodes emporiko Kentro pauei na agorazei ta erga tou, eno e kore kai o gampros tou ton proskaloun na metakomisei mazi tous mesa sto autarkes Kentro, opou e katanalose einai upokhreotike kai e demiourgia anepithumete. Me te gnoste aphegematike sunokhe kai dramatike entase, o Saramagkou khtizei ena pantodunamo kai apeiletiko Kentro pou katapinei ten pole guro tou, tis paragkoupoleis, tous agrous, tis palies tekhnes kai tous patroparadotous tropous zoes. Uparkhei, aletheia, luse; "E spelia" einai to proto meta to Nompel muthistorema pou egrapse o suggrapheas."™
–O "Bertheros" einai neaniko epistolographiko muthistorema tou Gkaite (1749-1832) pou, molis ekdotheke, to 1774, gnorise terastia epitukhia ste Germania, metaphrasteke suntoma se polles glosses kai askese megale epirroe ste zoe, ta ethe kai te moda akoma tes epokhes, aphou uperxe akome kai kostoumi se stul Bertherou. Egine antikeimeno mimeses kai parodias kai ekane amesos diasemo ton eikosipentakhrono suggraphea tou.
O "Bertheros", sumbolo tou kinematos Sturm und Drang (Thuella kai Orme), prodromou tou romantismou, einai e apolute ekphrase tes euaisthesias kai tes anazeteses tes eleutherias tou ego, mesa apo te sugkrouse tou anexelegktou pathous kai tes paraphoras me ton periguro kai tis koinonikes sumbaseis.
O Gkaite, pou ezese analoges empeiries me ton Berthero, diethete te thaumatourge ikanoteta na tautizetai me ton eroa tou sta pathe kai tautokhrona na ginetai krites, pairnontas tis anagkaies apostaseis. To muthistorema exephraze anesukhies tes neolaias prin apo ten epanastase tou 1789, sten idia eutheia me tis anazeteseis suggrapheon opos o Ritsarntson, o Rousso kai o Lessingk, stous opoious parapempei amesa o Gkaite.
O Bertheros agapa paraphora -alla adunatei na kataktesei- te Lotte, te mneste kai metepeita gunaika enos philou tou. Pothei ten exidanikeumene eikona tes kai xodeuetai psukhika, adunatontas na prosarmostei sten pragmatikoteta. S' auto to drama tes apousias, buthizetai sten ania kai te melagkholia, zeleuei, klaiei, ginetai to emblema tou mal de vivre. Monakhikos kai aprosarmostos, phetikhistes kai narkissos, apokleismenos ston erotiko tou potho, plegomenos kai paraphoros, diakatekhetai apo mia pnoe aphanismou kai anazeta ten aionia eleutheria tou thanatou.
Mesa apo ton problematismo gia ten apolute eleutheria ton epilogon tou atomou enantia sta ethe kai stis koinonikes sumbaseis, ginetai o sumbolikos megas muthistorematikos autokheiras tou romantismou, gia na ton akolouthesei, trianta khronia argotera, o Klaist, o allos megas autokheiras suggrapheas tou romantismou.
O "Bertheros" kuklophorei se nea metaphrase apo te Stella Nikoloude kai sunodeuetai apo ektene eisagoge, ergobiographia kai Epimetro me keimena tou Tomas Mann, tou Rolan Mpart k.a."œ
™

Ena tromaktiko paramuthi; Ena philosophiko thriler; Mia erotike phantasia;
Gia ton Zan-Mpatist Gkrenouig, ton skoteino eroa, mathainoume mono pos gennetheke stis 17 Iouliou 1738 sto Parisi, anamesa sta skoupidia tes agoras me duo idiaitera kharakteristika.
Autos pou tromazei tous pantes me ten pantele elleipse kathe murodias ekhei ten pio euaisthete mute tou kosmou. Katagraphei sten ateleiote trapeza tes mnemes tou oles tis murodies pou sunanta sto dromo tou, kai okhi mono auto, alla mporei na anakalesei kathe stigme ekeine pou tha dialexei.
E makria poreia tou sto basileio ton osmon tha ton odegesei apo to ergasterio tou aromatopoiou ste these tou emitheou pou parasurei ta plethe me monadiko oplo to upsisto kai sugklonistikotero aroma pou uparkhei. Auto tes anthropines uparxes."œ	
™	"E anthropoteta" eipe o Tzon Stiouart Mil, "de tha xekhasei pote pos uperxe kapoios Sokrates, kai katadikasteke se thanato epeide sugkrousteke me ten exousia kai me ten koine gnome tes epokhes tou".
Kati analogo tha mporouse na iskhuei kai gia ton Bilkhelm Raikh, pou odegetheke stis omospondiakes phulakes tes Amerikes me kategories pou semera tha ekanan kathe drasterio na khamogelasei - e na kagkhasei- kai ekei, stis phulakes, pethane loidoremenos apo ton Tupo kai ten koine gnome, aphou prolabe prota na dei tis theories tou na katadikazontai kai ta biblia tou na paradidontai sten pura.
O agapemenos mathetes tou Phrount egrapse to Akou, Anthropako to 1946, kai to demosieuse to 1948. Einai e krauge agonias enos megalou stokhaste, pou blepei ta spermata tou phasismou kai tou oloklerotismou mesa ston koino, kathemerino anthropo: auton pou katapiezetai kai epanastatei, kai pou ostoso mporei na proskunesei tous ekhthrous tou kai na dolophonesei tous philous tou.
Pou aisthanetai "laos", kai pou an tukhei na khristhei "ekprosopos" autou tou laou, kanei katakhrese tes exousias tou kai sumperipheretai pio banausa apo ten arkhousa taxe pou os tote ton eikhe sunthlipsei."

š
To apagoreumeno biblio, pou logokritheke os pornographiko kai kuklophorese eleuthera 30 khronia meta ton thanato tou Nt. Kh. Lorens, sugkatalegetai semera sta koruphaia aristourgemata tes erotikes logotekhnias tou 20ou aiona, os to ergo mias suggraphikes idiophuIas.
"0 erastes tes laides Tsaterli" einai to teleutaio muthistorema tou Nt. Kh. Lorens kai graphteke apo to 1926 eos to 1928, diastema kata to opoio o suggrapheas emene me te suzugo tou ste Phlorentia, antimetopizontas sobarotata problemata ugeias. E istoria tes omorphes pantremenes aristokratissas Konstans pou gnorizei te sexoualike eutukhia sten agkalia tou Melors, andra tes ergatikes taxes, sten pragmatikoteta kataggellei ta pouritanika ethe tes epokhes. To biblio uperxe petra skandalou kai prokalese ston Nt. Kh. Lorens problemata me te logokrisia kai to logotekhniko katestemeno. E kuklophoria tou apagoreuteke gia polla khronia sten Agglia kai stis EPA, opou kuklophorouse meso idiotikon (akome kai antigrammenon sto kheri) ekdoseon. To muthistorema pere ten adeia na kuklophoresei molis te dekaetia tou 1960, ustera apo polukrote dike* mia semantike nike ston polemo gia ten eleutheria tou logou. Ektote, katektese exekhousa these sten pagkosmia logotekhnia kai den epapse na diabazetai apo ekatommuria anagnostes se olo ton kosmo."¬
©Epta emeres polemou kai zoes...
Se ena steno perasma tou orous Kallidromou me te thalassa, pou legetai Thermopules, makria apo te geneteira tous, to 480 p.Kh. triakosioi epilektoi Spartiates polemistes apothesan tous khiliades polemistes tou Perse eisbolea kai edosan me gennaioteta te zoe tous, uperetontas me anidioteleia te demokratia kai ten eleutheria. Mia aple epigraphe se epitumbia stele deikhnei to meros opou einai thammenoi. Apo aute ten epitumbia stele empneusteke o suggrapheas kai sunedese me uperokho tropo te gnose me te phantasia, basizomenos stis authentikes logotekhnikes peges tou Erodotou, tou Platona, tou Ksenophonta kai pollon allon, alla kai sugkhronon istorikon ton opoion e demosieumene sophia boethese to suggraphea na epikheiresei na phantasteikhamenous kosmous kai politismous.
O Stiben Pressphilnt den etan stis Thermopules to 480 p.Kh., alla otan teleiosete to biblio tha nomizete oti etan, ki eseis mazi."¯
¬Ta Anemodarmena Upse, pou protoekdothekan to 1847, einai e agria kai gemate pathos istoria tes skhedon daimonikes agapes metaxu tes Kathrin Ernso kai tou Khethkliph. E drase tou muthistorematos einai khaotike kai biaia, alla e olokleromene sunthete dome tou, oi glaphures perigraphes tou thuellodous kai monakhikou agglikou topiou tou Giorksair kai e poietike megalosune tou oramatos tes Emilu Mpronte sunduazontai etsi oste to biblio na apoktesei to bathos kai ten aploteta mias arkhaias tragodias.
Touto to aristourgema, pou graphteke apo mia kopela eikosiephta eton kai demosieuteke ena khrono prin apo to thanato tes, sta trianta tes khronia, steketai isos os ena apo ta pleon prototupa erga tes agglikes glossas kai tes pagkosmias logotekhnias.
Ston enamise aiona tou biou tou ekhei goeteusei ekatommuria anagnostes, ekhei diegeirei kai ekhei prokalesei ten epinoetikoteta ekatontadon kritikon kai meleteton. Etan kai paramenei akome to demophilestero ergo tes agglikes logotekhnias kai sten istoria tes kritikes tou apotuponetai e istoria tes exelixes tes kritikes skepses ton neoteron khronon. Pano tou ekhoun dokimastei oles oi skholes kai oi taseis tes logotekhnikes kritikes.
Sten Ellada to ergo perase san phteno romantzo mesa apo tis ekdoseis gia ta karotsakia kai tis radiophonikes tou anagnoseis. E parousa ekdose epikheirei na xanadosei ten axia tou sto aristourgema auto tes logotekhnias tou 19ou ai. me te nea metaphrase tou Are Mperle kai ten ektene eisagoge tou, pou apotelei mia diadrome sten kritike antimetopise tou ergou apo ten emphanise tou mekhri semera."µ
²Paradoxia: "Sexoualike diegerse pou lambanei khora anexarteta apo ten periodo ton phusiologikon leitourgion sta gennetika organa".
Richard von Krafft-Ebing, Psychopathia Sexualis"¹

