I. 'Tolstoy on Shakespeare' - a critical essay on Shakespeare
II. 'Shakespeare's Attitude Toward The Working Classes'- Ernest Crosby
III. A Letter From Mr. G. Bernard Shaw
Count Lev Nikolayevich Tolstoy (1828-1910) commonly referred to in English as Leo Tolstoy, was a Russian writer - novelist, essayist, dramatist and philosopher - as well as pacifist Christian anarchist and educational reformer. He was the most influential member of the aristocratic Tolstoy family. His first publications were three autobiographical novels, Childhood, Boyhood, and Youth (1852-1856). They tell of a rich landowner's son and his slow realization of the differences between him and his peasants. As a fiction writer Tolstoy is widely regarded as one of the greatest of all novelists, particularly noted for his masterpieces War and Peace (1869) and Anna Karenina (1877). In their scope, breadth and realistic depiction of 19th-century Russian life, the two books stand at the peak of realist fiction. As a moral philosopher Tolstoy was notable for his ideas on nonviolent resistance through works such as The Kingdom of God is Within You (1894). During his life, Tolstoy came to the conclusion that William Shakespeare is a bad dramatist and not a true artist at all. Tolstoy explained his views in a critical essay on Shakespeare written in 1903."Á
¾Ena gramma kapoiou philou apo ta palia, ena phortio polutimon biblion kai enas phluaros papagalos erkhontai na kanoun ano kato ten ereme zoe ton enoikon tes odou Rabinian stous propodes tes Monmartes. Prospathontas na exikhniasoun ton periergo thanato tou philou tous anazetoun ten luse tou musteriou mesa stis selides mathematikon suggrammaton. E parea ton eroon kanei etsi ena taxidi stous aiones mesa apo ton magiko kosmo ton Mathematikon, enan kosmo polu pio anthropino ap' oso aphenoun na phanei oi periplokes exisoseis pou ton plaisionoun sunethos.
To Parisi, oi taxidiotikes perigraphes, e peripeteiodes aphegese kai ta Mathematika einai ta sustatika stoikheia autou tou ekrektikou meigmatos pou me ten morphe tou muthistorematos muei me diaskedastiko tropo megalous kai mikrous ston kosmo ton arithmon kai ste logike tous."Ä
ÁKapote zouse enas antras pou ton elegan Kharu, alla to kurio onoma tou etan Lukos tes Stepas. Pegaine me ta duo podia, ntunotan ki etan enas anthropos, sten pragmatikoteta omos etan enas Lukos tes Stepas. Eikhe mathei polla apo auta pou mporoun na mathoun anthropoi me dunato mualo ki etan enas arketa exupnos anthropos. Auto omos pou den eikhe katorthosei na mathei etan to exes: na 'nai eukharistemenos me ton eauto tou kai te zoe tou. Etsi etan enas anikanopoietos anthropos. Touto sunebaine kata ta phainomena, giati kathe toso exere apo ta base tes psukhes tou (e pisteue pos tha mathei) oti sten pragmatikoteta den etan anthropos alla enas lukos apo te stepa. Gia to zetema auto tha mporousan polloi sophoi anthropoi na diaphonesoun an pragmatika etan enas lukos e an kapote, isos prin apo te gennese tou, eikhe metamorphothei se luko apo anthropo, e an eikhe gennethei anthropos, alla etan proikismenos me psukhe enos lukou tes stepas kai ap' auten katekhotan gera, e an aute e piste, pos etan pragmati lukos, etan aplos mia upobole e mia arrostia. Tha 'tan dunato logou khare, o anthropos autos sta paidika tou khronia na 'tan agrios ki atithasos kai polu atakhtos ki oi daskaloi tou tha prospathesan na exoudeterosoun te zoode tou phuse ki etsi akribos me tis energeies autes tha sunetelesan na demiourgethei mesa tou aute e upobole kai e piste tou, pos sten pragmatikoteta etan ena zoo, me te lepte diakrise phusika pos eikhe mia agoge ki anthropine sumperiphora."Æ
ÃH Khariet Banier exaphanisteke prin apo trianta exi khronia kata te diarkeia enos kalokairinou phestibal sto souediko theretro Khentempi. Para tis ereunes tes astunomias, de bretheke pote kanena ikhnos tes dekaexakhrones kopelas. To eskase; Epese thuma apagoges; E thuma dolophonias; Kaneis de gnorizei - e upothese ekleise, oloi xekhasan tis leptomereies.
Oloi, ektos apo to theio tes Khariet, ton Khenrik Banier, enan elikiomeno biomekhano, pou ekhei balei skopo tes zoes tou na lusei to musterio protou pethanei. Stous toikhous tou grapheiou tou uparkhoun saranta tria kornizarismena louloudia. Ta epta prota etan dora apo ten anipsia tou. Ta upoloipa ephtanan anonuma kathe khrono sta genethlia tou.
Etsi arkhizei to MILLENNIUM, mia peripeteia egklematos kai timorias, sexoualikes diastrophes kai oikonomikes apates, alla kai mia truphere erotike istoria anamesa se enan katatregmeno demosiographo kai ena anorektiko koritsi me tatouaz, aso stous upologistes."Æ
ÃTo adiamphisbeteto aristourgema tes amerikanikes logotekhnias sten prote plere ellenike tou metaphrase.
Gia na grapseis ena megalo biblio, prepei na dialexeis ena megalo thema. Auto pou, apax kai to 'briske kaneis, xekatharizan kai ola ta upoloipa" (H. Melville)
"Lege me Ismael. Prin apo merika khronia -den ekhei semasia poso akribos- ekhontas liga e katholou khremata sto pougki mou kai tipota idiaitero pou na me endiapherei ste steria, skephteka na taxidepso ligo ste thalassa kai na do to udatino meros tou kosmou. Einai enas tropos pou ekho na diokhno to spleniasma kai na ruthmizo to kuklophoriako. Otan piano ton eauto mou na strabonei to stoma* otan mes sten psukhe mou einai Noembres ugros, pou psilobrekhei* otan piano ton eauto mou na stamataei athela mpros se pheretropoleia kai na ginetai ouragos kathe kedeias pou sunanto* kai eidika otan oi upokhondries mou me kubernoun toso, pou khreiazetai enas dunatos ethikos phragmos na me empodisei na bgo epitedes sto dromo kai methodika na rixo khamo ta kapela tou kosmou - tote theoro pos erthe pia e ora na mparkaro, oso pio gregora mporo. Einai to diko mou upokatastato tou pistoliou kai tes sphairas. Me mia philosophike kheironomia olo megaloprepeia, o Katon rikhnetai pano sto spathi tou* ego pairno esukha to ploio. Den uparkhei tipota to ekplektiko s' auto. An to exeran ephtane* oloi skhedon oi anthropoi, me ton tropo tous, arga e gregora, tha etrephan pano-kato ta idia aisthemata me mena gia ton okeano.""Ë
ÈO anagnostes krata sta kheria tou ena ergo khiliodiabasmeno, pou ekhei metaphrastei ametretes phores kai ekhei upoblethei se apeira skholia. Ena ergo pou gia kapoious einai diaphano kai timio, eno gia allous antitheta, einai diaboliko kai sukophantiko. O "Egemonas" ste sunarpastike poreia tou semadepse tous aiones prokalontas zoere aisthese, kataktontas anagnostes pou pistepsan oti brekan kai briskoun stis selides tou polutimes suntages gia na tis epharmosoun, allos sten politike, allos sto strato, allos sten erotike poliorkia, allos stis oikonomikes sunallages...
... O "Egemonas", to biblio pou ekane ton Makiabeli pagkosmia diasemo, ton apaskholese ede apo to 1513, ton proto khrono tes paramones tou sten exokhe.
... To ergo etan proion mias prosopikes kai ethnikes tragodias, pou demiourgetheke ostoso, mesa se ena pneuma elpidas"Ï
ÌO "Trupokarudos" einai ena eidos erotikes istorias pou ektulissetai mesa s' ena paketo tsigara Kamel. Apokaluptei to skopo tes selenes, exegei te diaphora anamesa stous kakopoious kai tous paranomous, exetazei te diamakhe anamesa sto desmeumeno sosialiste kai to romantiko atomikiste, zographizei to portraito mias sugkhrones koinonias me zaploutous Arabes, exoristous basiliades kai egkumonouses mazoretes. Telos, askholeitai kai me ta musteria ton puramidon."Ğ
ÍO mousikos Silben Pons dekhetai pia elakhistes proskleseis se geuma. Ta duo megala pathe tou e sulloge ergon tekhnes kai to kalo phageto, ton ekhoun katastesei phtokho suggene kai anepithumeto omotrapezo ton plousioteron suggenon tou. Ki eno proorizotan gia tis megales doxes tes mousikes suntheses, dieuthunei mia orkhestra se ena tapeino theatro. Sugkatoikei me ton exisou me auton askhemo alla agatho kai pisto philo, Germano pianista, Smouke* ton mono anthropo pou ton agapese.
Otan to proxenio pou etoimase gia ten kore ton suggenon tou nauagei, exostrakizetai. Pephtei arrostos baria. Tote xekina guro tou o khoros ton arpaktikon suggenon, giatron, dikegoron... pou diapistonoun te megale axia tes sulloges tou."Ö
Ó... Kato ap to kephali tou, opos etan xaplomenos me to pleuro, etan to pantaloni kai to sakaki tou, pou ta khe tulixei guro ap ta papoutsia tou gia na ta balei san proskephalo, kai sto pleuro tou etan to kruo metallo tou megalou automatou pistoliou, pou to khe bgalei ap te theke tou otan gdutheke kai to khe stereosei m ena petsino louraki ston dexio karpo tou. Esproxe pio kei to pistoli tou kai boleuteke akoma pio bathia ston upnosako, eno koitaze, pera ap to khioni, te skoteine, kophte skhismada mesa sta brakhia, pou etan e mpasia tes spelias. O ouranos etan katharos, kai to pheggos tes antanaklases tou khioniou tou phtane gia na blepei tous kormous ton dentron kai ton ogko ton brakhon pou trigurizan te spelia..."Ø
ÕSiddhartha
Este libro electronico tiene una mesa activa de los contenidos
Siddhartha es una novela de Hermann Hesse, que se ocupa del viaje espiritual de unnino conocido como Siddhartha del subcontinente indio durante el tiempo del Buda.
El libro, novena novela de Hesse, fue escrita en aleman, en un estilo sencillo peropotente y lirica. Se publico en los EE.UU. en 1951 y se convirtio en influyente durante ladecada de 1960. Hesse Siddharta dedicada a Ninon Hesse, su esposa.
La palabra Siddharta se compone de dos palabras en el idioma sanscrito, siddha(alcanzado) + artha (es decir, o la riqueza). Las dos palabras juntas significan "el queha encontrado el significado (de existencia)" o "el que ha alcanzado sus objetivos". El nombre del Buda, antes de su renuncia, fue el principe Siddharta Gautama. En estelibro, el Buda se refiere como "Gotama"."Ù
ÖEnas idealistes Portogalos ierapostolos, o iesouites Sempastiaou Rontrigkes, phtanei sten Iaponia tou 1640 gia na sumparastathei stous phrikta katapiezomenous khristianous Iapones, alla kai na anakalupsei ten aletheia pou krubetai piso apo ten apostasia tou prokatokhou tou, tou empeirou ierapostolou Phereira o opoios den antexe to marturio "tou lakkou" sto Nagkasaki. O Rontrigkes tha brethei ki autos polu gregora mprosta se tromera ethika dilemmata. Tha brethei, omos, kurios mprosta ste siope, ste siope tou Theou, pou moiazei na apodekhetai ta phrikta egklemata kai ta phrikta basanisteria sta opoia upokeintai oi pistoi Tou.
Apo ta aristourgemata tes iaponikes logotekhnias tou 20ou aiona, aute e "Siope" ekane pasignosto ton demiourgo tes ste Duse, o opoios, kai logo tes katholikes tou diapaidagogeses, apokletheke "o Iaponas Gkrakham Gkrin". Te nea aute ekdose tes "Siopes", prologizei o Martin Skorseze o opoios anelabe na metapherei sten othone to muthistorema tou Ento."ç
äKore enos mikroktematia, e Emma megalonei se monasteri opou, anamesa se akratous sunaisthematismous kai threskolepsies, plathei mia entelos pseutike eikona tes mellontikes zoes tes, gemate khlide, pathos kai buronikous erastes. E exodos tes ston kosmo einai mia anomale prosgeiose sten pragmatikoteta, pou ginetai akome pio odunere apo to gamo tes me ton agrotiko giatro Mpobaru kai apo ten asphuxia tou eparkhiakou perigurou. Mataia e Emma th' anazetesei diexodo se agkalies eraston."	
